OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal for car driver witness to
OL,4,Afatal crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice investigating a fatal road
OL,7,Ftraffic collision in Nottinghamshire
OL,8,Fare appealing for a witness to come
OL,9,Fforward.
OL,11,FA pedestrian, a woman in her 40s, died
OL,12,Ffollowing a collision with a motorcycle
OL,13,Fin Priestsic Road, Sutton-in-Ashfield,
OL,14,Fon 14 July.
OL,16,FAs part of the investigation, officers
OL,17,Fwould like to trace the driver of a
OL,18,Fdark coloured vehicle seen in a CCTV
OL,19,Fimage, Nottinghamshire Police said.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
